\f2\b \cf7 \cb8 ## Hardware Requirements
\f3\b0 \cf9 \cb8 \
\

\f2\b \cf10 \cb8 Minimum:
\f3\b0 \cf9 \cb8 \
- NVIDIA GPU with CUDA support\
- 8+ CPU cores\
- Linux (Ubuntu 22.04 recommended) or Windows with WSL2\
\

\f2\b \cf10 \cb8 GPU Memory Needed (rough guide):
\f3\b0 \cf9 \cb8 \
| Model Size | VRAM Needed |\
|------------|-------------|\
| 7-8B params | ~15 GB |\
| 70B params | ~131 GB |\
| Mixtral 8x7B | ~88 GB |\
\

\f2\b \cf10 \cb8 Consumer GPUs:
\f3\b0 \cf9 \cb8 \
- RTX 4090 (24GB) \uc0\u8594  Can run 7-8B models\
- RTX 3090 (24GB) \uc0\u8594  Can run 7-8B models\
\

\f2\b \cf10 \cb8 Data Center GPUs:
\f3\b0 \cf9 \cb8 \
- A100 (80GB) \uc0\u8594  Can run 70B models\
- H100 (80GB) \uc0\u8594  Best performance\
\
